{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっほーーーぃ☆\nろってぃーだよぉ*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は 全国握手会\nお疲れ様でしたぁ*´∀`*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様,\nスタッフの皆様\nメンバーのみんな\nありがとおございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のペアは\n可愛い可愛い\nとっても可愛い\nまいやん♪とだったよ〃ω〃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まる前に写真撮ったの(・ω・)\nいぇぃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/0813485/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん  と ろってぃー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/0813485/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だぁ〜い好きっ*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にねっ,\nまいやん♪とやりやすかったよ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん♪\nありがとう=・ω・="},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして,\nろってぃ〜むの皆様ぁ〜\n相変わらず\nめちゃくちゃ暖かい人の\nかたまりだったってばよ★☆★!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます〃_〃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は初めての方が\n多くて\n『ろってぃーむ。には\nどうしたら入れるのですか?』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆう質問が多かったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねえ、\nみんな ろってぃーむ。\nだよっ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーと喋った時点で\nはいっ ! ろってぃーむ。決まり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*・ω・)..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え?  それは強制的過ぎる?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに\nまいやん推しの皆様*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は 本当に\n優しくしてくださって\nすごく嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ?  めちゃいい人ばっかやん\n・∀・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、てか いい人しか\nいない*・ω・*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってました^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか 皆いっぱい話てくれたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの料理店とか\n聞きすぎて\n何から検索していこうかと\n思ったよ・∀・))笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜 ラーメンかあ\nあ〜  焼肉かあ\nあ〜  味噌かつかあ,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、それに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陰ナレのことも\nいっぱい言ってくれて\nありがとう・ω・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかっ,\nどんなだったあ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分喋ってたけど\n会場の方でどんな感じ\nに聞こえてたんだろう・∀・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nそんなかんぢゃってたあ´・ω?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に言えた気になってたら\nかみかみ だった...´・∀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ういぇ〜い ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブも握手会